### Integration Flows - End-to-End Scenarios

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4001
@contentType = application/json
@multipartType = multipart/form-data

### Test Users for Integration Scenarios
@studentUser = integration-student-001
@reviewerUser = integration-reviewer-001
@adminUser = integration-admin-001

### Scenario 1: Complete Internship Application Lifecycle
### =====================================================

### Step 1.1: Student creates draft internship application
# @name internshipScenario_CreateDraft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{studentUser}}",
    "application_type": "Internship",
    "status": "Brouillon",
    "type": "Internship",
    "data": {
        "company": "TechCorp Solutions",
        "position": "Full-Stack Developer Intern",
        "duration_months": 6,
        "start_date": "2025-09-01",
        "supervisor_name": "Sarah Johnson",
        "supervisor_email": "sarah.johnson@techcorp.com",
        "description": "Seeking an internship opportunity to apply my programming skills in a real-world environment. I am particularly interested in web development and want to gain experience with modern frameworks and development practices.",
        "requirements": "Strong knowledge of JavaScript, React, Node.js. Familiarity with databases and version control systems. Excellent communication skills and ability to work in a team environment."
    }
}

@internshipAppId = {{internshipScenario_CreateDraft.response.body.$.id}}

###

### Step 1.2: Upload resume document
