###

### Step 1.4: Verify application with documents
# @name internshipScenario_VerifyDraft
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{internshipAppId}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### Step 1.5: Submit application for review
# @name internshipScenario_SubmitForReview
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{internshipAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "en_attente",
    "feedback": "Application submitted for review. All required documents have been uploaded."
}

###

### Step 1.6: Reviewer requests changes
# @name internshipScenario_RequestChanges
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{internshipAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "modification_demandee",
    "feedback": "Please provide more details about your technical skills and include examples of previous projects. Also, clarify your availability for the internship duration."
}

###

### Step 1.7: Student updates application
# @name internshipScenario_UpdateApplication
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{internshipAppId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{studentUser}}",
    "application_type": "internship",
    "status": "modification_demandee",
    "type": "Internship",
    "data": {
        "company": "TechCorp Solutions",
        "position": "Full-Stack Developer Intern",
        "duration_months": 6,
        "start_date": "2025-09-01",
        "supervisor_name": "Sarah Johnson",
        "supervisor_email": "sarah.johnson@techcorp.com",
        "description": "Seeking an internship opportunity to apply my programming skills in a real-world environment. I have completed several projects including a full-stack e-commerce application using React and Node.js, and a mobile app using React Native. I am available full-time for the entire 6-month duration and am eager to contribute to your development team.",
        "requirements": "Strong knowledge of JavaScript (3+ years), React (2 years), Node.js (2 years), PostgreSQL and MongoDB databases, Git version control, Docker basics. Portfolio available at github.com/johndoe. Excellent communication skills and proven ability to work in agile team environments."
    }
}

###

### Step 1.8: Upload portfolio document
# @name internshipScenario_UploadPortfolio
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{internshipAppId}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="portfolio.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.4
Portfolio document with project examples and technical achievements
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

portfolio
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### Step 1.9: Resubmit for review
# @name internshipScenario_Resubmit
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{internshipAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "en_attente",
    "feedback": "Application updated with additional details and portfolio. Ready for final review."
}

###

### Step 1.10: Final approval
# @name internshipScenario_FinalApproval
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{internshipAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "approuvee",
    "feedback": "Congratulations! Your internship application has been approved. The updated portfolio and detailed technical skills demonstration convinced us of your qualifications. You will receive further instructions about the onboarding process via email."
}

###

### Step 1.11: Verify final state
# @name internshipScenario_VerifyFinalState
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{internshipAppId}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

