### Scenario 2: Incubation Project Application Flow
### ================================================

### Step 2.1: Entrepreneur creates incubation application
# @name incubationScenario_CreateApplication
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{studentUser}}",
    "application_type": "incubation",
    "status": "brouillon",
    "type": "Incubation",
    "data": {
        "project_name": "EcoSmart Waste Management",
        "business_model": "B2B SaaS platform that uses IoT sensors and AI to optimize waste collection routes for municipalities and waste management companies. Revenue streams include monthly subscriptions, data analytics services, and consulting fees.",
        "target_market": "Municipal waste management departments, private waste collection companies, smart city initiatives. Target market size of $15B globally with 30% annual growth in smart waste management solutions.",
        "funding_amount": 250000.00,
        "team_size": 4,
        "project_stage": "MVP Development",
        "description": "Our platform combines IoT sensors in waste bins with machine learning algorithms to predict optimal collection schedules, reducing fuel costs by 40% and increasing operational efficiency. We have completed market research and are currently developing our MVP with initial pilot customers lined up."
    }
}

@incubationAppId = {{incubationScenario_CreateApplication.response.body.$.id}}

###

### Step 2.2: Upload business plan
# @name incubationScenario_UploadBusinessPlan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{incubationAppId}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="business_plan.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.4
Comprehensive business plan document with market analysis, financial projections, and growth strategy
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

business_plan
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### Step 2.3: Upload team information
