### Step 2.4: Submit incubation application
# @name incubationScenario_Submit
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{incubationAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "en_attente",
    "feedback": "Incubation application submitted with complete business plan and team information."
}

###

### Step 2.5: Request additional financial projections
# @name incubationScenario_RequestFinancials
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{incubationAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "modification_demandee",
    "feedback": "Excellent project concept! Please provide detailed 5-year financial projections, competitive analysis, and risk assessment. Also include information about intellectual property and any existing partnerships or customer commitments."
}

###

### Step 2.6: Upload additional documents
# @name incubationScenario_UploadFinancials
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{incubationAppId}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="financial_projections.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.4
Detailed 5-year financial projections with revenue forecasts, expense breakdown, and funding requirements
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

financial_projections
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### Step 2.7: Approve incubation application
# @name incubationScenario_Approve
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{incubationAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "approuvee",
    "feedback": "Congratulations! Your incubation application has been approved. The comprehensive business plan, strong team composition, and realistic financial projections demonstrate excellent potential. You will be contacted by our incubation team within 48 hours to begin the onboarding process."
}

