### Scenario 3: PFE Application with Academic Focus
### ===============================================

### Step 3.1: Student creates PFE application
# @name pfeScenario_CreateApplication
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{studentUser}}",
    "application_type": "pfe",
    "status": "brouillon",
    "type": "Pfe",
    "data": {
        "title": "Machine Learning for Predictive Maintenance in Industrial IoT Systems",
        "supervisor_name": "Dr. Elena Rodriguez",
        "company": "Industrial Automation Solutions",
        "academic_year": "2024-2025",
        "specialization": "Computer Science - Machine Learning",
        "objectives": "Develop and implement machine learning algorithms for predictive maintenance in industrial IoT environments. Create a system that can predict equipment failures with 90% accuracy and reduce unplanned downtime by 50%.",
        "methodology": "Literature review of ML techniques for predictive maintenance, data collection from industrial sensors, feature engineering, model development using Random Forest and LSTM networks, validation with real-world industrial data, performance benchmarking.",
        "expected_outcomes": "Functional predictive maintenance system, trained ML models with validated accuracy, industrial deployment pilot, research paper publication, and open-source toolkit for industrial applications."
    }
}

@pfeAppId = {{pfeScenario_CreateApplication.response.body.$.id}}

###

### Step 3.2: Upload research proposal
# @name pfeScenario_UploadProposal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{pfeAppId}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="research_proposal.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.4
Detailed research proposal with literature review, methodology, timeline, and expected contributions
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

research_proposal
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### Step 3.3: Submit PFE application
# @name pfeScenario_Submit
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{pfeAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "en_attente",
    "feedback": "PFE application submitted with detailed research proposal and industrial partnership."
}

###

### Step 3.4: Approve PFE application
# @name pfeScenario_Approve
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{pfeAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "approuvee",
    "feedback": "Excellent research proposal! The combination of academic rigor and industrial application makes this an ideal PFE project. Approved for 2024-2025 academic year."
}

