### Scenario 6: Error Recovery and Edge Cases
### ==========================================

### Step 6.1: Attempt invalid status transition
# @name errorRecovery_InvalidTransition
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{internshipAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "brouillon",
    "feedback": "Attempting to move approved application back to draft"
}

###

### Step 6.2: Upload to non-existent application
# @name errorRecovery_UploadToNonExistent
@fakeAppId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{fakeAppId}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

Test content
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

test
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### Step 6.3: Query with invalid parameters
# @name errorRecovery_InvalidQuery
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications?application_type=invalid&status=nonexistent&page=-1&limit=0
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### Step 6.4: Verify system still functional after errors
# @name errorRecovery_VerifySystemHealth
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### Final Integration Test: Verify All Created Applications
# @name integration_FinalVerification
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications?user_id={{studentUser}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

